<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Private Sessions — Tailored Sound Work</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071219;--panel:#0d1318;--accent:#91d2c9;--muted:#97a6b2}
    body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%,#0b2030,transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg,#071219,#031015);color:#eafbf9;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px}
    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    nav a{color:#cfeee9;margin-left:16px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .wrap{padding:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}
    h2{margin:0 0 8px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .cta{margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#022428;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .features{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .feature{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .pill{width:44px;height:44;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);display:grid;place-items:center}
    .note{margin-top:14px;color:#f3d6b3;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(224,196,122,0.05)}
    /* small booking panel */
    .side{position:sticky;top:20px}
    .rate{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* proof gallery mini */
    .proof-mini{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    /* accessibility */
    .kbd{background:#071219;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:880px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:14px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo"><div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#91d2c9,#3db1bf)"></div><div style="font-weight:700">Sound Sessions</div></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Sessions</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Private intensives</h2>
        <p class="muted">One-on-one or small private groups for focused relaxation, integration, or targeted support. Sessions shaped to a clear intention: sleep, release, or focus. Suitable for clients seeking deeper work or tailored protocols.</p>

        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature"><div class="pill">🔔</div><div><strong>Personalized structure</strong><div class="muted">Intake, protocol, and gentle integration time.</div></div></div>
          <div class="feature"><div class="pill">🪶</div><div><strong>Supportive environment</strong><div class="muted">Low chairs, bolsters, and soft lighting available.</div></div></div>
          <div class="feature"><div class="pill">🎵</div><div><strong>Tonal toolkit</strong><div class="muted">Bowls, chimes, voice, and tuned percussion chosen for intention.</div></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="note">Contraindications: If you have conditions sensitive to vibration or loud sound, implanted medical devices, pregnancy concerns, or a history of seizures, please consult a clinician before booking. For clarity contact <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>

        <div style="margin-top:16px">
          <a class="cta" href="book.html">Request a Private Session</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
        <strong>Session formats</strong>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">
          <li><strong>Focused reset</strong> — 50 minutes (intake + 30–40 minute sound ~) best for sleep aid or stress regulation.</li>
          <li><strong>Deep integration</strong> — 90 minutes with extended integration and debrief.</li>
          <li><strong>Group private</strong> — tailored for up to 6 people (pricing varies).</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="proof-mini" id="miniProof">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Client note</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">“Made space to stop sprinting. The session brought a steadier center for days.” — L.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="side">
      <div class="card">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div class="meta">Private session starting at</div>
            <div class="rate">$140</div>
            <div class="meta">(50-minute focused reset)</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a class="cta" href="book.html">Book Now</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Custom packages and practitioner collaborations available. Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a> for program design.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
        <strong>Location</strong>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Private sessions take place in a quiet therapeutic room in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Remote sessions via guided sound + voice are available on request.</div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer style="padding:20px;color:var(--muted)">Questions or notes for a private session? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"pricing.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Rates & Packages</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071016;--card:#08141a;--accent:#8bd3c7;--muted:#9fb0bd}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071016,#041018);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:#eafbf9}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 26px}
    nav a{color:#cfeee9;margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:18px}
    .hero{padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px}
    .toggle{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px;border-radius:999px;display:inline-flex;gap:6px}
    .toggle button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .toggle button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#032023}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .plan{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .price{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:var(--accent)}
    .per{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .compare{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .cta{margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#042026;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
    .note{margin-top:12px;color:#f3d6b3;background:rgba(224,196,122,0.05);padding:10px;border-radius:8px}
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">Rates</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <h1 style="margin:0">Clear pricing for gatherings and intensives</h1>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Choose what fits: single sessions, monthly supports, or a small-series package for deeper work.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px">Show as</div>
        <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
          <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button>
          <button id="packageBtn">Package</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid" id="plans">
      <div class="plan" data-monthly="28" data-package="240">
        <div style="font-weight:800">Group • Weekly</div>
